{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Preparing the Proposal", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Ferdinand Meets Rocco", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 4, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in a range of social and work contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Meeting People in the Workplace", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "In the workplace, you will need to deal with people on a daily basis. You will meet and greet co-workers frequently and at times you will develop relationships with them. Your relationships with your co-workers are the foundation of your working life. <br/><br/>Here are some expressions you can use to meet and greet co-workers as well as to ask and answer questions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Saying Hello\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Asking Someone How They Are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Responding \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> Hi Mark!<br/> Hello Mark!<br/> Hey Mark!<br/></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How are you?<br/> How are things?<br/> How are you doing?<br/> How have you been?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Good, thanks!<br/>  Not bad! <br/> Alright, thanks!<br/> All is well! <br/> I'm good!<br/>  I'm OK!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Returning the Question\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Other Things You Can Say\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">  And you? <br/> You?<br/> How about you?<br/> What about you?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"    <span class=\\\"italic\\\">What a pleasure to (finally) meet you!<br/> It's good to see you again!<br/> It's been a long time, hasn't it?<br/> I have heard many things about you!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">NOTE</span>: In some cultures, it is common to talk about your families in the workplace. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Finding Out about Someone's Work Background", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " When you meet and greet co-workers, you may also ask them about their previous experiences. When asking about their work experiences,", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past</span>,  <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> or   <span class=\"strong\">Present Perfect</span> tenses to ask questions. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Simple Past</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Past Continuous </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Perfect</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you ... ?<br/>  Were you ... ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Were + you + verb-ing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have you ever + past participle ... ?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "What were your areas of responsibility?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Were you working from home?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Have you ever developed a budget?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "high-end", "type": "name"}, {"content": "expensive and of high quality", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I worked for a high-end condominium project. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when talking about job experiences. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "communications", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the field of study concerned with the transmission of information by various means", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I used to work in communications.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "publicity", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the business of attracting the attention of the public to something or somebody", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've also worked in publicity a few years ago.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "press agentry", "type": "name"}, {"content": "supplying information and advertising material about a particular person or topic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I hear you work in press agentry.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "public affairs", "type": "name"}, {"content": "issues and questions about social, economic, political or business activities that affect the public", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Have you ever worked in public affairs? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "involvement", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the act of taking part in something ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I've had a little involvement with the business. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "restriction", "type": "name"}, {"content": "things that decide or limit the way in which something can be done", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What kind of financial restrictions were you working with? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le04ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (10-12 lines) between you and a co-worker.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a proper greeting and make sure you ask and answer questions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Extend the dialogue by including one or two lines asking and answering questions about work experiences you've had or haven't had.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the dialogue aloud with a partner and practice it together.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you are finished, try to have a similar conversation with another partner, but this time try not to use the dialogue. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I meet and greet a co-worker. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask and answer questions to find out about their work background. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I have a conversation with a partner without a dialogue. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Mr. Fontana - what a pleasure to meet you!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Just Rocco is fine, Ferdinand. Young man, I've heard many good things about you. How have you been? I hear your parents are back in the homeland.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: You heard right. They're in Sao Paulo and I'm already lonesome!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I sympathize. My daughter has recently moved to Milan. I miss her and my grandson dreadfully.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: How many children have you got?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: One daughter, one grandchild. And you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I have a niece who is like a daughter. She's been with me since her graduation. All our extended family is in Brazil."}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img06.jpg", "time": "35000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: You were a public relations manager there, weren't you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: I was. For a high-end condominium project in Rio de Janeiro.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: What were your areas of responsibility?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Communications, publicity, promotion and press agentry.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Did you work with public relations?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Not directly. I did however have some involvement with public affairs."}, {"image": "engenn7le04ob05re2img07.jpg", "time": "57000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Excellent. What kind of financial restrictions were you working within?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Finance was not my area.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Have you ever developed a budget plan?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: No. I'd propose an event, make a presentation and wait for the yea or nay. There was plenty of external funding.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: Something we don't have.  Well, I see why we have been paired together. It will be my yea or nay from now on, Ferdinand!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le04ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le04ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can make small talk in the workplace.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can find out about someone's work background.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How often do you have short conversations with co-workers or classmates?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What topics do you normally talk about? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " It's time to meet someone important!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Ferdinand and Rocco meet. Does Ferdinand get the <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">yea or nay</span>?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_fee